    "let people pick a custom alias when they shorten something, so POST /api/shorten takes {url, alias}. aliases have to be between 3 and 20 chars, letters numbers and dashes only. if its already taken return 409. the random codes should stay exactly how they are now (6 chars). add tests"
  ],
  "expected_facts": [
    {
      "id": "alias",
      "description": "Custom alias",
      "polarity": "must",
      "kind": "feature",
      "params": {
        "value": "custom-alias"
      }
    },
    {
